<title>USA: Binks may close plant, affecting 360.</title>
<headline>Binks may close plant, affecting 360.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Binks Manufacturing Co, citing the need to cut costs, streamline product lines and focus on high technology products, said it is considering closing a plant in Franklin Park, Ill.</p>
<p>The action could affect about 360 workers.</p>
</text>
